Heckler is a documentary, comedy film directed by Michael Addis.

3
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:26,000
HECKLER is a comedic feature documentary exploring the
increasingly critical world we live in.

4
00:17:46,666 --> 00:17:52,666
After starring in a film that was critically bashed, Jamie Kennedy takes on hecklers and critics and ask some interesting
questions of people such as George Lucas, Bill Maher, Mike Ditka, Rob Zombie, Howie Mandel and many more.

5
00:22:13,333 --> 00:22:19,333
This fast moving, hilarious documentary pulls no punches as you see an uncensored look at just how
nasty and mean the fight is between those in the spotlight and those in the dark.

